Phase 1 of gshop's admin-screen_20261010 track: gshop's planned admin inventory screen needed a way to list inventory rows and look up by sku, which inventory-service had no endpoint for (only GET /inventorys/{id} by internal UUID). Added GET /inventorys with an optional sku query param -- omitted returns all rows, present filters to just that sku (empty list if no match). New InventoryStore.list(sku: Option[String]) on the trait, in-memory impl (Map filter), and postgres impl (two skunk queries, select-all vs select-by-sku). Wired into both the test-only routes() aggregator and Main.scala's explicit endpoint list. TDD throughout: store tests (in-memory + postgres/testcontainers), route tests (list/filter/empty/logging), full suite green (85 tests).
